---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Laije Belthassar BALONG, analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage"
  description="Portfolio de Laije Belthassar BALONG, Business Analyst à Brazzaville. Analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage, du recueil du besoin à la recette."
>

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 48px 64px; padding: 88px 0 88px">
<div style="flex: 999 1 520px; min-width: 0">
<h1 style="margin: 0; max-width: 16ch; font-weight: 600; font-size: 68px; line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.035em">Analyse métier et maîtrise d'ouvrage<span style="color: #3F6B57">.</span></h1>
<p style="margin: 28px 0 0; max-width: 56ch; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.5; color: #17191A"></p>
<p style="margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 56ch; font-size: 17px; color: #4A504E"></p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px">
<a href="#projets" class="btn btn-main" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; background: #3F6B57; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Voir les projets</a>
<a href="mailto:laijebalong@gmail.com" class="btn btn-line" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 50px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #D5D9D4; color: #17191A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px">Me contacter</a>
</div>
</div>
<figure style="flex: 0 1 300px; max-width: 300px; margin: 0">
<div role="img" aria-label="Emplacement de la photo de Laije Belthassar BALONG" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; border-radius: 28px; background: #F1F4F2; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px">
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3.8" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M4.5 20.5c0-4.1 3.4-7 7.5-7s7.5 2.9 7.5 7" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M9.5 20.5h5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<span style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160">[Votre photo, format 4 x 5]</span>
</div>
<figcaption style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #5B6160"><span>Laije Belthassar BALONG</span><span>Brazzaville</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="methode" style="padding: 40px; margin-bottom: 104px; border-radius: 24px; background: #F1F4F2">
<h2 id="methode" style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -0.015em">De la demande à la livraison</h2>
<p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #5B6160">Chaque étape renvoie au projet qui la prouve.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 32px 0; margin-top: 36px">
<div style="position: relative; padding: 24px 24px 0 0; border-top: 2px solid #C9D7CE">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1F4F2; border: 2px solid #3F6B57; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 14px"><path d="M5 4.5h12A2 2 0 0 1 19 6.5v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-6l-4.5 3.5v-3.5H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M7 8.5h8M7 11.5h4.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px">Recueillir le besoin</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Entretiens, Business Case et BRD.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px">Ndako Tech</a>
