<div style="position: relative; padding: 24px 24px 0 0; border-top: 2px solid #C9D7CE">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1F4F2; border: 2px solid #3F6B57; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 14px"><rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="5" rx="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><rect x="14.5" y="15.5" width="7" height="5" rx="1.2" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="2.5" fill="#FFFFFF"></circle><path d="M9.5 6h6M6 8.5v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h6.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px">Modéliser le processus</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">BPMN, couloirs, décisions, exceptions.</p>
<a href="/projet-ouverture-compte" class="lnk" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px">Ouverture de compte</a>
</div>
<div style="position: relative; padding: 24px 24px 0 0; border-top: 2px solid #C9D7CE">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1F4F2; border: 2px solid #3F6B57; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 14px"><path d="M3.5 6h8M3.5 10h6M3.5 14h4"></path><path d="M13 20.5l-3.2.7.7-3.2 7.8-7.8a1.8 1.8 0 0 1 2.5 2.5z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><path d="M16.8 11.5l2.5 2.5" stroke="#3F6B57"></path></svg>
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px">Rédiger les exigences</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">User stories priorisées en MoSCoW.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px">Ndako Tech</a>
</div>
<div style="position: relative; padding: 24px 0 0 0; border-top: 2px solid #3F6B57">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3F6B57"></span>
<svg aria-hidden="true" width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 14px"><path d="M9 5H7A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 5.5 6.5v13A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 7 21h10a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5-1.5v-13A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 17 5h-2" fill="#FFFFFF"></path><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="1" fill="#F1F4F2"></rect><path d="M9 13.5l2 2 4-4" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg>
<p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px">Vérifier par la recette</p>
<p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #4A504E">Cas de test, anomalies, décision.</p>
<a href="/projet-ndako-tech" class="lnk" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px">Ndako Tech</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="projets" style="padding-bottom: 104px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Projets</h2>
<a href="/projets" class="lnk" style="font-size: 15px">Tous les projets</a>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">

<article id="bpmn" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
<figure style="flex: 3 1 480px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; background: #F1F4F2">
<svg viewBox="0 0 860 300" role="img" aria-label="Schéma BPMN simplifié de l'ouverture d'un compte, en trois couloirs : client, agence, conformité" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; font-family: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif">
<defs><marker id="fl" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#5B6160"></path></marker></defs>
<rect x="0.5" y="0.5" width="859" height="299" rx="10" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#D5DCD7"></rect>
<line x1="96" y1="0" x2="96" y2="300" stroke="#D5DCD7"></line>
<line x1="0" y1="100" x2="860" y2="100" stroke="#D5DCD7" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
<line x1="0" y1="200" x2="860" y2="200" stroke="#D5DCD7" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
<text x="16" y="55" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Client</text>
<text x="16" y="155" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Agence</text>
<text x="16" y="255" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#5B6160">Back-office</text>
<circle cx="124" cy="50" r="9" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
<path d="M133 50 H148" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<rect x="150" y="28" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="204" y="47" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Se renseigner,</text>
<text x="204" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">réunir les pièces</text>
<path d="M258 50 H310 V126" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<rect x="256" y="128" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="310" y="147" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Vérifier</text>
<text x="310" y="162" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">les pièces</text>
<path d="M364 150 H398" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<polygon points="420,128 442,150 420,172 398,150" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<text x="420" y="190" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#4A504E">Pièces conformes ?</text>
<path d="M420 128 V76" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="428" y="66" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">non : revenir avec les pièces</text>
<path d="M442 150 H500 V226" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="452" y="143" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">oui</text>
<rect x="446" y="228" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#B9C6BE"></rect>
<text x="500" y="247" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">Filtrage et</text>
<text x="500" y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#17191A">risque</text>
<path d="M554 250 H588" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<polygon points="610,228 632,250 610,272 588,250" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#3F6B57" stroke-width="1.5"></polygon>
<text x="610" y="292" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#4A504E">Contrôle validé ?</text>
<path d="M632 250 H700 V74" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<text x="642" y="243" font-size="11" fill="#5B6160">oui</text>
<rect x="646" y="28" width="108" height="44" rx="8" fill="#3F6B57"></rect>
<text x="700" y="47" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#FFFFFF">Retirer</text>
<text x="700" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#FFFFFF">la carte</text>
<path d="M754 50 H806" stroke="#5B6160" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#fl)"></path>
<circle cx="818" cy="50" r="10" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#17191A" stroke-width="3"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Vue simplifiée. L'étude complète compte 9 étapes, 2 décisions et les exceptions du back-office, tracées en pointillés.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div style="flex: 2 1 300px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 8px 8px 8px 0">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px">
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #E6EEE9; color: #2F5444; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Modélisation BPMN</span>
<span style="padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #F1F2EF; color: #4A504E; font-size: 13px">Étude personnelle, octobre 2026</span>
</p>
<h3 style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Ouverture d'un compte particulier en agence</h3>
<p style="margin: 12px 0 0; color: #4A504E">Où un client perd-il du temps pour ouvrir un compte ? J'ai modélisé le parcours supposé d'après la réglementation CEMAC et la ligne directrice COBAC n° 1-2025, sans donnée interne de banque.</p>
<dl style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 24px 0 0">
<div><dt style="font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Couloirs</dt><dd style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px">3</dd></div>
<div><dt style="font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Points à vérifier</dt><dd style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px">4</dd></div>
<div><dt style="font-size: 13px; color: #5B6160">Pistes MoSCoW</dt><dd style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 24px">5</dd></div>
</dl>
<a href="/projet-ouverture-compte" class="lnk" style="align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 24px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500">Lire l'étude</a>
</div>
</article>

<article id="ndako" class="card" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; flex-direction: row-reverse; gap: 40px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E3E5E1">
